    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When distress strikes, in locations hard to reach, people will often depend on life saving helicopters. Join the helicopter rescue service and be part of the solution in this arcade style simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up the role of a helicopter pilot and fly your craft to its designated locations so help and service can be provided to those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the gameplay in these types of missions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search &amp; Rescue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural disaster assistance and rescue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medical evacuation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firefighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express supplies deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy goods transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and improve your helicopter fleet by successfully completing missions at hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features simple to use controls and a gameplay experience that is easy to learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When distress strikes, in locations hard to reach, people will often depend on life saving helicopters. Join the helicopter rescue service and be part of the solution in this arcade style simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up the role of a helicopter pilot and fly your craft to its designated locations so help and service can be provided to those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the gameplay in these types of missions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search &amp; Rescue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural disaster assistance and rescue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medical evacuation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Firefighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express supplies deliveries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy goods transport</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and improve your helicopter fleet by successfully completing missions at hand.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features simple to use controls and a gameplay experience that is easy to learn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
